# OWNERSHIP-MATRIX - action-level ownership (schema template)

One row per action set. This template carries the fixed columns and an empty state; it contains
no live rows. Append-only: rows are never rewritten or removed.

## Action-level ownership

| action | domain | owner role | allowed decisions | forbidden decisions | owned files | upstream approval |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| (empty state) | - | - | - | - | - | - |

## Invariants

1. No two writers touch the same file.
2. A role may not write outside its owned files.
3. Only roles named in `records/ROSTER.txt` are addressed.
4. Read-back outranks a worker's report: reports are claims until verified on disk.
